Trump claimed the Wisconsin Supreme Court decision declaring ballot drop boxes illegal "includes the 2020 Presidential Election." That  defies logic, and the court’s order itself. The state Supreme Court itself has explicitly permitted the drop boxes in some past elections. And its order is prospective — for the future, not the past. And that’s an assessment from the group that filed the lawsuit. We rate this  .   window.gciAnalyticsUAID = 'PMJS-TEALIUM-COBRAND';
